NextTavern's pi-ai adapter derives from DeepSeek Harness llm-pi-ai 0.1.7-rc.2,
commit 477b4f420553e8a52c2fbccc464d7561b239c443. DeepSeek's original MIT terms
are in LICENSE.upstream. The adapter targets Harness >=0.2.2-rc.5 and uses
NextTavern's bundled pi-ai 0.85.1 SDK.

The NextTavern public repository carries the maintained source under
development/llm-pi-ai. ORIGIN.json records the upstream files, modification
scope and the separate formal fork synchronization status.
